# The one image built from this repository is the cloud machine's
# (cloud/machine/Dockerfile), with the repository as its build context. wrangler
# hands Docker the Dockerfile on stdin, so a Dockerfile.dockerignore next to it
# would not be read: this file keeps everything else out of the context.
*
!tools/install-release.sh
!core/src/agent/launch.rs
!cloud/machine/
